From 2c7d1f5bfec140639315a274a54a5c26052ccc13 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 13:27:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add answer gate: fail-closed committee for RAG answers

New self-contained module (orchestrator/src/answer_gate) next to the PR-gate debate engine:
- Hallucination Critic, Tenant Security Auditor (veto) and Coherence Validator
- fail-closed protocol: full quorum, security veto, unanimity; faults/timeouts/invalid verdicts block
- portal HMAC assertion (tenant only in the signed assertion, bound to the body, single-use jti)
- ContextRAG client with per-tenant API keys and strict response validation
- POST /v1/answer-gate/reviews (contract answer-review.v1) and docs/answer_gate.md
- 57 jest tests; the 130 existing tests are untouched

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
